    "sections": {
        "description": "This Laundry Cleaning theme is designed for businesses that offer laundry services, dry cleaning, garment care, or home pickup and delivery solutions. It provides a clean layout with structured sections for service listings, pricing tables, contact forms, and customer inquiries. The design focuses on usability, allowing visitors to quickly understand services, check rates, and request bookings. It can be used by local laundry shops, dry cleaners, small service startups, and professional cleaning agencies looking to build an online presence. Key features include responsive design, fast loading speed, SEO-friendly structure, service showcase blocks, and easy customization options. It also supports essential website elements like testimonials, service categories, and location details. Overall, this Laundry Cleaning layout is suitable for users who want a simple, functional, and user-focused website to manage and present their cleaning services efficiently."
    },
